## 5. Aturan Bisnis (Business Rules)

| ID | Aturan | Prioritas |
|----|--------|-----------|
| **BR-01** | Satu ruang tidak boleh dua booking overlap (`[start, end)`). | Must |
| **BR-02** | Booking hanya masa depan; lead time minimal {{MIN_LEAD_MINUTES}} menit. | Must |
| **BR-03** | Cancel hanya organizer, ≥ {{CANCEL_WINDOW_HOURS}} jam sebelum start (admin override + alasan). | Must |
| **BR-04** | Durasi min {{MIN_DURATION_MIN}} menit, max {{MAX_DURATION_HOURS}} jam. | Must |
| **BR-05** | Ruang nonaktif tidak di picker booking. | Must |
| **BR-06** | Nama organizer tampil di kalender bersama. | Must |
| **BR-07** | Email notifikasi bilingual ID+EN dalam satu message. | Must |
| **BR-08** | Admin dapat cancel kapan saja dengan alasan (audit). | Should |
| {{BR_EXTRA_ROWS}} | | |

