## 6. Functional Requirements (FR)

### 6.1 Autentikasi & Profil

| FR ID | Deskripsi | Prioritas | BR Ref |
|-------|-----------|-----------|--------|
| FR-01 | Login via mekanisme auth IT | Must | — |
| FR-02 | Profil display name untuk organizer | Must | BR-06 |
| FR-03 | Role employee vs admin | Must | — |

### 6.2 Master Ruang

| FR ID | Deskripsi | Prioritas | BR Ref |
|-------|-----------|-----------|--------|
| FR-04 | Admin CRUD / nonaktifkan ruang | Must | BR-05 |
| FR-05 | Atribut ruang: kode, nama, lokasi, kapasitas, fasilitas | Must | — |
| FR-06 | Daftar ruang aktif + filter | Must | — |

### 6.3 Booking

| FR ID | Deskripsi | Prioritas | BR Ref |
|-------|-----------|-----------|--------|
| FR-07 | Buat booking (ruang, judul, start, end) | Must | BR-01–04 |
| FR-08 | Tolak bentrok, pesan jelas | Must | BR-01 |
| FR-09 | Booking sendiri upcoming/history | Must | — |
| FR-10 | Cancel organizer (BR-03) | Must | BR-03 |
| FR-11 | Kalender slot + nama organizer | Must | BR-06 |
| FR-12 | Admin lihat semua booking + override cancel | Should | BR-08 |

### 6.4 Notifikasi

| FR ID | Deskripsi | Prioritas | BR Ref |
|-------|-----------|-----------|--------|
| FR-13 | Email konfirmasi create | Must | BR-07 |
| FR-14 | Email reminder (offset configurable) | Should | BR-07 |
| FR-15 | Email cancel | Must | BR-07 |

### 6.5 Audit & Reporting

| FR ID | Deskripsi | Prioritas | BR Ref |
|-------|-----------|-----------|--------|
| FR-16 | Audit log mutasi booking/ruang | Must | — |
| FR-17 | Export CSV (admin) | Could | — |

